PaymentRails_OwnershipTransfer
├── transferOwnership
│   ├── when caller is not owner
│   │   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│   ├── when caller is owner
│   │   ├── it should set pendingOwner
│   │   └── it should NOT change current owner
│   └── when transferring to zero address
│       └── it should set pendingOwner to zero (cancels transfer)
├── acceptOwnership
│   ├── when caller is not pendingOwner
│   │   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│   └── when caller is pendingOwner
│       ├── it should update owner to pendingOwner
│       ├── it should reset pendingOwner to zero
│       └── it should allow new owner to call onlyOwner functions
└── full lifecycle
    ├── it should allow old owner to operate until new owner accepts
    └── it should block old owner after new owner accepts
